@startuml target_conversation_states
' Source baseline: pi-mono-java dfb90cac4e233e09a0b8f047f7e9f4682f5ad238.
' Source evidence: frontend/src/App.vue running, submit; frontend/src/composables/useRuntimeApi.ts abort, matchesPendingSubmission.
' Observed behavior: connection state and execution state overlap; confirmation uses text matching.
' Target-only UI state design; not new HTTP enums.
' Design reason: accepted writes, confirmation, and connection loss cannot imply completion.
title Conversation state - target-only product model
hide empty description
[*] --> Ready
Ready --> Submitting : explicit send / freeze draft
Submitting --> Running : complete receipt
Submitting --> Uncertain : receipt missing
Running --> Confirming : verified pending tool
Confirming --> DecisionPending : allow or deny
DecisionPending --> Running : complete decision receipt
Running --> Stopping : explicit stop
Confirming --> Stopping : explicit stop
Stopping --> StopAccepted : complete interrupt receipt
StopAccepted --> Ready : reliable target terminal
Running --> Ready : reliable target terminal
Running --> Uncertain : connection loss
DecisionPending --> Uncertain : uncertain decision
Stopping --> Uncertain : uncertain stop
StopAccepted --> Uncertain : no target terminal
Uncertain --> Reconciling : read only
Reconciling --> Uncertain : insufficient evidence
Reconciling --> Running : current execution verified
Reconciling --> Confirming : current pending call verified
Reconciling --> Ready : current readiness verified
note right of Confirming
No second message or config write.
A historical confirmation card is read-only.
end note
note bottom of Uncertain
Keep draft and confirmed content.
Never replay a write automatically.
No same-text correlation.
No arbitrary old idle as current terminal.
end note
@enduml
